---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import PageHead from "../components/PageHead.astro";
import { SITE } from "../config";
// Mirrors the privacy text inside the app. Update both together.
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy policy: no data collected"
  description="GitaVerse collects nothing. The app has no internet permission, no accounts, no analytics and no ads. Your notes and progress stay on your phone."
>
  <main id="main">
    <PageHead
      title="Privacy policy"
      lead="Last updated 5 November 2026. Applies to GitaVerse and this website."
    />
    <section class="light">
      <div class="wrap prose">
        <p>
          GitaVerse is made to be private. This is a plain summary of how the
          app treats your information.
        </p>
        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>
          Nothing. GitaVerse has no accounts, no ads, no analytics and no crash
          reporting, and the app has no permission to use the internet. We never
          receive anything you read, save or write.
        </p>
        <h2>What stays on your phone</h2>
        <p>
          Your name (if you add one), reading progress, streak, saved verses,
          collections, notes and settings are kept only on your phone, inside
          the app. They are removed when you uninstall the app or clear its
          storage, and they are not part of Android’s cloud backup.
        </p>
        <h2>Notifications</h2>
        <p>
          If you turn on the daily reminder, the app asks for permission to show
          notifications. The reminder is scheduled on your phone and nothing is
          sent anywhere.
        </p>
        <h2>Sharing, backups and exports</h2>
        <p>
          When you share a verse or your notes, or save a backup file, the text
          goes only to the app or place you choose. GitaVerse does not see or
          keep a copy. Keep backup files safe: they hold your notes as plain
          text.
        </p>
        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>
          GitaVerse does not collect personal information from anyone, including
          children.
        </p>
        <h2>This website</h2>
        <p>
          This website uses no cookies, no analytics and no third-party scripts,
          and its fonts are served from the site itself. It is hosted on
          Cloudflare, which, like any web host, processes standard request data
          such as IP addresses to deliver pages and keep the service secure.
          Links to Google Play and GitHub are governed by those services’ own
          policies.
        </p>
        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          If this ever changes, the app and its store page will say so before
          the change takes effect. Questions: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.mail}`}
            >{SITE.mail}</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
